   Key to column headings:
   
   GEOTYPE     Type of geography                                           
   MSA         MSA or CMSA code      (9999=not in MSA, 0000 in New England)
   PMSA        PMSA code             (9999=not in PMSA,0000 in New England)
   TEXT        Geographic area name                                        
   POP92  Population estimate, July 1, 1992                           
   POP90  Population count, April 1, 1990                             
   POP87  Population estimate, July 1, 1987        (N/A for new areas)
   POP82  Population estimate, July 1, 1982        (N/A for new areas)
   POP80  Population count, April 1, 1980          (N/A for new areas)
